# QA Testing Toolkit

A collection of practical QA testing activities performed using industry-standard testing tools including Apache JMeter and OWASP ZAP.

## 📌 Project Overview

This repository demonstrates hands-on experience in:

* Performance Testing using Apache JMeter
* Security Testing using OWASP ZAP
* Test Data Analysis
* Test Report Generation
* Quality Assurance Best Practices

## 🛠️ Tools Used

* Apache JMeter
* OWASP ZAP
* Selenium WebDriver
* Java
* CSV Reports
* HTML Reports

## 🚀 Performance Testing

Performance testing was conducted using Apache JMeter to evaluate website responsiveness and stability.

### Activities Performed

* Created and executed JMeter test plans
* Generated HTML dashboard reports
* Analyzed response times and throughput
* Evaluated APDEX scores
* Reviewed request success rates

### Artifacts

* JMeter Test Plans (.jmx)
* CSV Result Files
* HTML Dashboard Reports
* Test Execution Screenshots

## 🔒 Security Testing

Security testing was performed using OWASP ZAP to identify potential vulnerabilities in web applications.

### Activities Performed

* Automated vulnerability scanning
* Security risk assessment
* Alert analysis and reporting
* Vulnerability identification

### Artifacts

* OWASP ZAP Reports
* Security Scan Results
* Vulnerability Summaries
* Test Screenshots

## 📊 Key Learning Outcomes

* Understanding of Performance Testing concepts
* Hands-on experience with Apache JMeter
* Understanding of Security Testing fundamentals
* Practical usage of OWASP ZAP
* Experience analyzing test reports and metrics
* Exposure to QA testing workflows

